WEBVTT

00:01.150 --> 00:05.410
<b>The war between humans and demons
comes to a fever pitch.</b>

00:05.740 --> 00:08.680
<b>Pretending to back up
the soldiers in Urum's Castle,</b>

00:08.680 --> 00:11.910
<b>Azudra lay in wait for
Mikaros in Tooru's Castle.</b>

00:12.290 --> 00:14.100
<b>At the same time, Hyura fights with Edil.</b>

01:46.030 --> 01:51.050
<b>Break the Curse</b>

01:54.430 --> 01:56.370
<b>You want to fight me like that?</b>

01:56.370 --> 01:58.560
<b>Are you making light of me
because of my injury?</b>

01:58.980 --> 02:02.370
<b>I won't lose to someone like you
even if both my eyes are crushed.</b>

02:02.610 --> 02:05.360
<b>Shut up! The fight has only just begun!</b>

02:10.700 --> 02:12.030
<b>You're pissing me off!</b>

02:12.030 --> 02:14.590
<b>If you won't fight me seriously,
then scram.</b>

02:15.290 --> 02:17.800
<b>You think I'll fight against those idiots?</b>

02:17.960 --> 02:19.060
<b>They're throw me off my game!</b>

02:19.260 --> 02:20.970
<b>I mean, I get what you mean.</b>

02:21.380 --> 02:24.040
<b>I don't do well with
that relaxed air of theirs.</b>

02:24.460 --> 02:26.210
<b>It reminds me of my old friends.</b>

02:28.300 --> 02:29.800
<b>That's what's good about you.</b>

02:30.130 --> 02:32.240
<b>I can point my sword
at you without hesitation.</b>

02:32.640 --> 02:34.200
<b>In that case...</b>

02:34.550 --> 02:35.780
<b>Fight me more seriously!</b>

02:36.010 --> 02:38.950
<b>I'll spit those words right back at you!</b>

02:40.520 --> 02:41.410
<b>How's that?</b>

02:41.560 --> 02:43.830
<b>I'm already different from
when you first met me.</b>

02:43.830 --> 02:46.020
<b>You've grown, but so have I!</b>

02:46.320 --> 02:47.480
<b>I'll just knock you back down.</b>

02:47.670 --> 02:51.820
<b>Yeah, that's what I want!
If you become stronger, I also will!</b>

02:52.160 --> 02:53.570
<b>I'll keep fighting you.</b>

02:53.580 --> 02:55.700
<b>Over and over,
until I can catch up to you!</b>

02:56.120 --> 02:59.870
<b>I'll crush your soul until
you can't stand back up again!</b>

03:00.120 --> 03:01.330
<b>Crush my soul?</b>

03:01.790 --> 03:02.870
<b>You can't do that.</b>

03:04.380 --> 03:07.100
<b>Because I always enjoy fighting you!</b>

03:07.420 --> 03:11.090
<b>I don't mind losing if it's with you.
I'll keep doing it again, and again!</b>

03:11.630 --> 03:13.510
<b>I might even want to
keep fighting you forever!</b>

03:14.510 --> 03:15.100
<b>What?</b>

03:15.300 --> 03:16.910
<b>And then, I'll...</b>

03:17.180 --> 03:17.970
<b>Wait, time out.</b>

03:18.450 --> 03:19.070
<b>What?</b>

03:19.310 --> 03:21.540
<b>You don't think it's wrong
to smile while saying that?</b>

03:21.730 --> 03:23.480
<b>Why are you being all happy and sparkly?</b>

03:23.700 --> 03:24.540
<b>Huh?</b>

03:25.230 --> 03:27.520
<b>Have you been looking
forward to fighting me?</b>

03:27.940 --> 03:29.210
<b>"If it's with you," you said?</b>

03:29.480 --> 03:30.900
<b>"If"?</b>

03:31.190 --> 03:33.420
<b>N-No, don't take it the wrong way!</b>

03:33.420 --> 03:36.200
<b>It's not like that! Fighting you
is not hard, that's what I mean!</b>

03:36.370 --> 03:37.910
<b>You understand the conversation, right?</b>

03:38.180 --> 03:40.300
<b>It's not like what you think at all, okay?</b>

03:40.450 --> 03:42.390
<b>I just got attacked by you
a couple of times,</b>

03:42.390 --> 03:44.100
<b>so I got a little excited and...</b>

03:44.100 --> 03:45.170
<b>Uh, um...</b>

03:45.250 --> 03:46.130
<b>I'll kill you!</b>

03:46.420 --> 03:48.960
<b>I get it. Calm down a little.</b>

03:51.320 --> 03:52.470
<b>Right.</b>

03:52.470 --> 03:57.240
<b>I came here to destroy you,
and the demons, the cause of this war.</b>

03:57.720 --> 03:59.490
<b>Ah. He just let his guard down for a bit.</b>

03:59.910 --> 04:03.600
<b>Absolute obedience to the king.
His orders are my utmost priority.</b>

04:03.950 --> 04:05.250
<b>- Utmost priority...
- How strange.</b>

04:05.730 --> 04:09.480
<b>Saying stuff like "absolute obedience",
but also getting all attached to me.</b>

04:09.920 --> 04:12.460
<b>That's why...
That's why I have to kill her...</b>

04:12.460 --> 04:16.070
<b>Also, he's been unstable
for the last while...</b>

04:16.700 --> 04:17.720
<b>S-Sorry.</b>

04:18.080 --> 04:19.800
<b>I won't say anything unnecessary again.</b>

04:19.800 --> 04:21.080
<b>Let's resume our fight.</b>

04:22.120 --> 04:26.250
<b>Is he possibly starting to
be freed from the king's spell?</b>

04:27.210 --> 04:29.140
<b>This country's king?</b>

04:29.380 --> 04:33.220
<b>Yeah. You can say that the king
is the reason I'm here.</b>

04:33.400 --> 04:34.480
<b>Hmm.</b>

04:34.630 --> 04:38.550
<b>I was told to not talk to
the citizens about the king, though....</b>

04:38.800 --> 04:39.890
<b>But, well...</b>

04:40.180 --> 04:42.370
<b>Asta, you're a foreigner, so...</b>

04:42.470 --> 04:43.430
<b>I wonder if it's okay.</b>

04:43.430 --> 04:45.830
<b>Yeah, I think it's fine to tell me!</b>

04:45.940 --> 04:47.150
<b>But, you know...</b>

04:47.350 --> 04:49.110
<b>Yes, it's okay to tell me!</b>

04:50.230 --> 04:50.920
<b>I guess so.</b>

04:50.920 --> 04:51.730
<b>Alright!</b>

04:53.360 --> 04:56.150
<b>Actually, you've already
gotten what you're here for.</b>

04:58.740 --> 05:00.080
<b>I'm the king.</b>

05:03.390 --> 05:06.790
<b>Just kidding! Were you surprised?
Were you surprised? Haha!</b>

05:06.960 --> 05:08.270
<b>Um, okay...</b>

05:08.420 --> 05:10.250
<b>Why was she making that scary face?</b>

05:10.850 --> 05:13.630
<b>If you want to meet him,
I'll tell you where he is.</b>

05:14.840 --> 05:17.380
<b>In exchange for that, take me with you.</b>

05:19.430 --> 05:20.680
<b>Cless, and Helck...</b>

05:21.050 --> 05:22.260
<b>I want to see everyone.</b>

05:22.930 --> 05:24.720
<b>Get me out of here.</b>

05:30.810 --> 05:32.210
<b>Cless and Helck...</b>

05:32.400 --> 05:36.280
<b>Right. This girl is connected
to those hero brothers.</b>

05:37.150 --> 05:41.660
<b>She's also definitely locked up
in here because she's important.</b>

05:42.280 --> 05:44.010
<b>This girl doesn't know anything.</b>

05:44.120 --> 05:46.930
<b>Not even the fact that
we're in a war with humans,</b>

05:47.160 --> 05:50.920
<b>or that there are barely
any humans left who are normal.</b>

05:52.880 --> 05:54.500
<b>I've kept it within me all this time,</b>

05:54.880 --> 05:57.840
<b>but after talking a lot with you,
Asta, I can't hold it back anymore.</b>

05:58.510 --> 06:01.550
<b>I don't want to keep living
with uncertainty anymore.</b>

06:02.140 --> 06:03.720
<b>I want to see everyone else again.</b>

06:05.310 --> 06:07.140
<b>I want to see them and eat together again.</b>

06:07.430 --> 06:09.690
<b>To eat on the terrace
while seeing the sunset.</b>

06:10.060 --> 06:12.150
<b>To eat delicious food with Cless.</b>

06:12.400 --> 06:14.770
<b>To eat Helck's delicious cooking...</b>

06:15.070 --> 06:16.740
<b>All she wants is to eat.</b>

06:17.530 --> 06:19.780
<b>I see. I guess that's the case.</b>

06:20.410 --> 06:22.030
<b>Sorry. Give me a minute.</b>

06:22.410 --> 06:24.030
<b>I don't know anything about it,</b>

06:24.030 --> 06:25.580
<b>but I can guess what it's like.</b>

06:25.830 --> 06:28.040
<b>Being locked up in here all of a sudden,</b>

06:28.290 --> 06:31.210
<b>and not being able to meet anyone...
You'd feel so uncertain about things.</b>

06:31.460 --> 06:33.690
<b>You must be thinking that
something is happening.</b>

06:37.470 --> 06:38.760
<b>M-Maybe...</b>

06:40.470 --> 06:43.350
<b>Maybe I can help you see Helck.</b>

06:43.680 --> 06:46.430
<b>He's with someone I know right now.</b>

06:47.330 --> 06:49.730
<b>Ah, but don't expect too much.</b>

06:50.440 --> 06:52.900
<b>I wanna see him! I wanna see Muscly Helck!</b>

06:53.230 --> 06:55.580
<b>So you know him?!</b>

06:55.580 --> 06:57.130
<b>More like an acquaintance
of an acquaintace...</b>

06:57.130 --> 06:58.840
<b>Come on, you should've said so!</b>

06:58.840 --> 07:00.130
<b>I want to meet him! I want to!</b>

07:00.200 --> 07:01.990
<b>I get it! Let's go see him.</b>

07:02.450 --> 07:03.840
<b>Alright! Alright!</b>

07:04.070 --> 07:05.580
<b>Asta, thank you!</b>

07:08.390 --> 07:10.100
<b>I ended up telling her that.</b>

07:10.290 --> 07:12.500
<b>I really am not suited
for this kind of work.</b>

07:15.630 --> 07:18.420
<b>Either way,
we have to escape to the town first.</b>

07:18.670 --> 07:20.520
<b>Asta, over here!</b>

07:24.220 --> 07:26.050
<b>You're more agile than I thought!</b>

07:26.390 --> 07:28.180
<b>I'm good at climbing trees.</b>

07:28.930 --> 07:31.230
<b>This is not a tree, it's a wall!</b>

07:31.810 --> 07:34.980
<b>I'm actually really good at sports.</b>

07:35.360 --> 07:37.170
<b>I never lost to Cless.</b>

07:37.270 --> 07:37.890
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:38.110 --> 07:39.650
<b>When we were little, that is.</b>

07:40.030 --> 07:42.860
<b>Once we grew up,
I couldn't beat him at all.</b>

07:43.700 --> 07:46.160
<b>That hero doesn't go easy, huh?</b>

07:46.410 --> 07:49.490
<b>This is the only thing
I can say I'm good at now.</b>

07:50.330 --> 07:51.750
<b>Let me show you, Asta.</b>

07:54.080 --> 07:55.920
<b>Oh! Special ability!</b>

07:58.670 --> 07:59.370
<b>Snow?</b>

07:59.560 --> 08:01.570
<b>No, I don't think it's that.</b>

08:02.090 --> 08:05.470
<b>It's an ability that spreads
other powers over a large area.</b>

08:05.890 --> 08:07.640
<b>I don't get it either, though.</b>

08:07.740 --> 08:09.260
<b>Just spread it?</b>

08:09.780 --> 08:10.400
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:11.270 --> 08:12.730
<b>Spreading it...</b>

08:14.140 --> 08:16.060
<b>Spreading other powers?</b>

08:16.230 --> 08:19.420
<b>If it's poison?
If it's something you can't block?</b>

08:19.480 --> 08:21.480
<b>This ability is quite terrifying!</b>

08:21.990 --> 08:23.630
<b>Taking her out of here...</b>

08:23.630 --> 08:26.530
<b>It might be very beneficial
to us in the war.</b>

08:27.160 --> 08:28.580
<b>Hey, Asta.</b>

08:29.080 --> 08:30.580
<b>Hm? W-What is it?</b>

08:30.990 --> 08:32.830
<b>I don't know this path.</b>

08:33.250 --> 08:34.960
<b>I've never been here.</b>

08:35.250 --> 08:36.060
<b>Let's go back, okay?</b>

08:37.140 --> 08:39.250
<b>B-But Sharuami, you...</b>

08:39.880 --> 08:41.590
<b>Huh? I-I see.</b>

08:42.010 --> 08:44.800
<b>I was the one leading the way, was I?</b>

08:45.180 --> 08:47.340
<b>Right. I guess that's right.</b>

08:47.840 --> 08:48.890
<b>This is weird.</b>

08:49.260 --> 08:51.600
<b>Why did I choose this path?</b>

08:52.140 --> 08:53.600
<b>Something's weird...</b>

08:53.600 --> 08:54.740
<b>Weird...</b>

08:55.880 --> 08:57.480
<b>Sharuami? What's...</b>

09:03.650 --> 09:05.280
<b>Let's run. Someone's coming.</b>

09:07.200 --> 09:08.260
<b>This is strange...</b>

09:08.450 --> 09:10.220
<b>I can't hear any footsteps,</b>

09:10.410 --> 09:12.410
<b>but something's closing in on us.</b>

09:33.470 --> 09:34.600
<b>T-The king?</b>

09:34.890 --> 09:36.560
<b>I didn't feel his presence...</b>

09:50.070 --> 09:51.620
<b>Sharuami?! What are you...</b>

09:54.490 --> 09:56.250
<b>No, this is...</b>

09:58.160 --> 10:00.330
<b>What are you doing,
deciding things on your own?</b>

10:01.500 --> 10:04.810
<b>Don't put any spells on Sharuami
that's not in the plan,</b>

10:04.810 --> 10:06.050
<b>you fallen country king.</b>

10:15.390 --> 10:16.520
<b>Sharuami!</b>

10:17.740 --> 10:18.740
<b>A demon...</b>

10:19.480 --> 10:23.310
<b>I see. So you're the presence
I felt back then.</b>

10:23.730 --> 10:27.320
<b>You pulled the wool over our eyes
and even reached Sharuami.</b>

10:27.690 --> 10:28.990
<b>That's impressive.</b>

10:41.580 --> 10:43.380
<b>That was close.</b>

10:43.710 --> 10:47.840
<b>The awakened humans are
docile only due to the king's magic.</b>

10:48.470 --> 10:53.090
<b>Without it, they're just like
monsters who only destroy and slaughter.</b>

10:53.430 --> 10:58.270
<b>No, maybe even monsters with strength
rivaling new world organisms.</b>

10:58.430 --> 10:59.700
<b>Don't feed me those lies!</b>

10:59.700 --> 11:01.490
<b>I won't be fooled by those bluffs...</b>

11:02.230 --> 11:04.480
<b>Unfortunately, this is the truth.</b>

11:05.900 --> 11:09.040
<b>If you kill the king,
the invasion will stop,</b>

11:09.040 --> 11:12.160
<b>but that will only
bring forth a new threat.</b>

11:12.910 --> 11:15.950
<b>You all have already been crushed.</b>

11:17.490 --> 11:18.680
<b>Lady Vermilio...</b>

11:18.870 --> 11:19.870
<b>Ista...</b>

11:22.210 --> 11:24.930
<b>What's with this anxiousness?</b>

11:25.920 --> 11:26.800
<b>Asta...</b>

11:27.300 --> 11:28.550
<b>I wonder if she's okay.</b>

11:35.930 --> 11:38.890
<b>A war is not a solitary fight,
but everyone's fight.</b>

11:39.140 --> 11:41.780
<b>The reason why you can't kill me...</b>

11:41.980 --> 11:44.100
<b>...savor it!</b>

11:45.520 --> 11:46.690
<b>Curse release.</b>

11:47.900 --> 11:52.450
<b>Leaving them alive
so they won't revive is a mistake.</b>

11:56.320 --> 11:57.280
<b>That can't be...</b>

12:06.630 --> 12:12.270
<b>That is someone who has been released from
the king's spell and fallen to new world's power.</b>

12:12.270 --> 12:15.720
<b>The final befitting of humans
who wish to be heroes.</b>

12:16.050 --> 12:21.890
<b>Had they grown more, they would've
become "that" and be more powerful...</b>

12:22.180 --> 12:27.360
<b>But even now, they should have power
equal to those of new world organisms.</b>

12:27.690 --> 12:29.110
<b>An enemy like this...</b>

12:29.360 --> 12:31.090
<b>Even if there's two, it wouldn't be...</b>

12:32.740 --> 12:34.150
<b>That sound from outside just now...</b>

12:34.990 --> 12:36.070
<b>Could it be...</b>

12:36.450 --> 12:40.830
<b>I doubt I would be able to
take you down with just those two.</b>

12:41.240 --> 12:45.600
<b>I've released the curse on all of
the winged soldiers in Tooru's Castle.</b>

12:45.710 --> 12:48.430
<b>About two thousand monsters
will attack this castle</b>

12:48.430 --> 12:51.440
<b>and attack your soldiers with it!</b>

12:51.920 --> 12:53.130
<b>What are those?!</b>

12:54.220 --> 12:56.400
<b>I will never be able to win against you.</b>

12:56.400 --> 13:00.110
<b>But we can win against you all.</b>

13:00.310 --> 13:05.230
<b>When it comes to battles,
surpassing you is easy for me.</b>

13:05.640 --> 13:08.450
<b>It is necessary for 
the birth of the new world!</b>

13:08.450 --> 13:10.360
<b>A powerful army!</b>

13:10.360 --> 13:13.080
<b>The power to have that with ease</b>

13:13.080 --> 13:16.240
<b>was the power I was seeking!</b>

13:17.530 --> 13:18.260
<b>Hon!</b>

13:18.450 --> 13:19.370
<b>Here.</b>

13:19.780 --> 13:20.620
<b>Retreat.</b>

13:20.990 --> 13:22.370
<b>Take everyone to Urum's Castle.</b>

13:23.010 --> 13:24.330
<b>L-Lord Azudra...</b>

13:24.330 --> 13:26.160
<b>We can still reduce our losses!</b>

13:27.670 --> 13:28.670
<b>U-Understood!</b>

13:29.830 --> 13:31.210
<b>Guardian Tree, I'm sorry.</b>

13:32.460 --> 13:34.010
<b>The power of the trees, to its last...</b>

13:34.630 --> 13:36.050
<b>Please lend it to me.</b>

13:37.090 --> 13:39.390
<b>Are you planning to fight them all?</b>

13:46.560 --> 13:48.140
<b>Wow, that's...</b>

13:48.440 --> 13:49.870
<b>Everyone, retreat!</b>

13:49.870 --> 13:52.250
<b>Everyone with enough strength left,
take the injured with you!</b>

13:52.250 --> 13:53.710
<b>Hey, wait a minute!</b>

13:53.710 --> 13:54.900
<b>This is...</b>

13:57.340 --> 13:58.740
<b>What's happening now?</b>

14:08.310 --> 14:10.120
<b>Things aren't looking good!
We're heading head out!</b>

14:10.540 --> 14:12.060
<b>Don't act so friendly!</b>

14:12.130 --> 14:13.140
<b>Let me go!</b>

14:13.140 --> 14:15.460
<b>I don't need any help from humans!</b>

14:15.760 --> 14:17.570
<b>I don't want you to die!</b>

14:18.840 --> 14:21.400
<b>No, it's because I'm the only one
who gets to defeat you, okay!</b>

14:21.400 --> 14:23.180
<b>Alright, I get it.</b>

14:29.140 --> 14:31.790
<b>He's still trying to attack...</b>

14:31.790 --> 14:34.370
<b>But he should be at his limit now.</b>

14:34.690 --> 14:35.960
<b>Just one more...</b>

14:35.960 --> 14:37.690
<b>If there's anything that will...</b>

14:40.590 --> 14:41.710
<b>Edil?</b>

14:45.790 --> 14:50.470
<b>I see. So he's gotten enough
mental fortitude to resist the spell...</b>

14:51.620 --> 14:53.040
<b>In that case...</b>

14:53.920 --> 14:57.510
<b>I'm sure this is the continuation
of that day the snow fell.</b>

14:57.880 --> 14:59.820
<b>That's how they end up being.</b>

15:00.430 --> 15:01.720
<b>Those are humans.</b>

15:02.140 --> 15:04.200
<b>Why are you just fine, then?</b>

15:04.390 --> 15:06.490
<b>Because you have high affinity?</b>

15:06.720 --> 15:07.720
<b>Possibly.</b>

15:08.180 --> 15:09.330
<b>Lord Azudra...</b>

15:09.580 --> 15:11.890
<b>He's trying to buy us time.</b>

15:12.150 --> 15:15.110
<b>I have to protect Lord Azudra,
even if it costs me my life.</b>

15:15.730 --> 15:18.500
<b>Hey. Please carry me again.</b>

15:18.990 --> 15:20.030
<b>Don't push your luck!</b>

15:20.280 --> 15:22.170
<b>Oh, alright. Then, I don't need it.</b>

15:22.740 --> 15:24.030
<b>I didn't say I won't do it!</b>

15:24.950 --> 15:26.380
<b>Come on. Hold on to me.</b>

15:26.580 --> 15:28.540
<b>Your personality is annoying.</b>

15:28.640 --> 15:30.160
<b>Shut up! Just hurry!</b>

15:32.100 --> 15:33.920
<b>It's strange.</b>

15:34.540 --> 15:36.880
<b>You used to look more repulsive to me,</b>

15:37.300 --> 15:40.170
<b>but looking at you again like this,
it doesn't seem like that at all.</b>

15:40.510 --> 15:42.780
<b>What weird stuff are you
saying to yourself now?</b>

15:42.780 --> 15:43.890
<b>That's gross.</b>

15:44.340 --> 15:45.340
<b>Helck...</b>

15:46.010 --> 15:47.430
<b>Just like you said,</b>

15:47.720 --> 15:50.640
<b>maybe there's a way for us
to settle this without fighting.</b>

15:51.640 --> 15:52.950
<b>No, nothing.</b>

15:53.100 --> 15:55.040
<b>Come on, hurry! Don't waste time!</b>

15:55.310 --> 15:57.020
<b>You're the one who's doing that!</b>

16:02.630 --> 16:05.970
<b>So you broke free from
the king's spell on your own.</b>

16:06.260 --> 16:06.950
<b>Spell?</b>

16:07.280 --> 16:08.740
<b>So Edil really is...</b>

16:08.870 --> 16:10.470
<b>Hyura, you go and run.</b>

16:10.620 --> 16:13.030
<b>What? Don't say that crap...</b>

16:13.030 --> 16:14.680
<b>You still have your comrades.</b>

16:14.870 --> 16:16.420
<b>Don't risk your life here.</b>

16:17.250 --> 16:22.090
<b>An awakened hero with a sense of
self grows faster, for some reason.</b>

16:22.320 --> 16:25.570
<b>I was expecting you
to be a good fighter...</b>

16:25.800 --> 16:26.760
<b>But I knew it.</b>

16:26.970 --> 16:29.570
<b>Soldiers shouldn't have a sense of self!</b>

16:32.060 --> 16:35.540
<b>You're just one human in an experiment.</b>

16:38.690 --> 16:44.820
<b>And that's why, if you fail,
I can just destroy you anytime!</b>

16:47.280 --> 16:49.090
<b>Mind break!</b>

16:51.200 --> 16:53.010
<b>If you lose your mental fortitude,</b>

16:53.010 --> 16:55.920
<b>you won't be able to resist
the power of the new world!</b>

16:56.080 --> 16:58.170
<b>Go and be a warrior of the new world!</b>

17:03.190 --> 17:05.270
<b>What an eyesore.</b>

17:05.420 --> 17:07.420
<b>You can't regenerate right now.</b>

17:07.800 --> 17:10.300
<b>I'll make sure to put you down
for good this time.</b>

17:13.020 --> 17:15.600
<b>That can't be! He resisted it?!</b>

17:16.480 --> 17:17.650
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

17:17.650 --> 17:19.910
<b>That was his last mental strength.</b>

17:19.910 --> 17:22.650
<b>He's being swallowed
by the new world's power!</b>

17:28.570 --> 17:29.700
<b>I can feel it...</b>

17:29.910 --> 17:32.790
<b>The tremendous power of the new world...</b>

17:33.040 --> 17:36.290
<b>Until this world meets its end...</b>

17:36.540 --> 17:38.710
<b>...the fight shall go on!</b>

17:41.170 --> 17:42.060
<b>Edil!</b>

17:42.060 --> 17:42.840
<b>Don't come closer!</b>

17:43.920 --> 17:46.010
<b>Run. Run away.</b>

17:47.300 --> 17:49.360
<b>This fight won't continue for much longer.</b>

17:49.360 --> 17:50.570
<b>It'll be over soon.</b>

17:51.140 --> 17:52.050
<b>That man...</b>

17:52.720 --> 17:55.140
<b>Helck will put an end to it.</b>

17:55.780 --> 17:57.240
<b>Until then, you must hold on.</b>

17:58.080 --> 17:59.580
<b>Mind your own business!</b>

17:59.580 --> 18:02.010
<b>Why are you worried about us?!</b>

18:02.010 --> 18:03.610
<b>Worry about yourself!</b>

18:05.570 --> 18:06.650
<b>You're right.</b>

18:07.030 --> 18:09.240
<b>Why am I worried about you lot?</b>

18:10.160 --> 18:12.680
<b>If you're as awful as they say,</b>

18:12.830 --> 18:14.620
<b>then I wouldn't feel like this.</b>

18:15.540 --> 18:16.410
<b>Who was it?</b>

18:16.910 --> 18:18.750
<b>Who told me that they're wicked beings?</b>

18:19.420 --> 18:20.640
<b>Pull yourself together!</b>

18:21.210 --> 18:23.750
<b>Didn't you say
you were going to defeat me?!</b>

18:30.430 --> 18:33.430
<b>I said something cruel to you before.</b>

18:38.390 --> 18:39.390
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

18:39.810 --> 18:41.600
<b>Don't... die.</b>

18:42.100 --> 18:43.150
<b>Hyura.</b>

18:44.020 --> 18:45.190
<b>Wait, Edil.</b>

18:45.730 --> 18:47.150
<b>Fight me!</b>

18:47.990 --> 18:49.070
<b>Edil!</b>

18:59.410 --> 19:00.710
<b>Lord Azudra...</b>

19:10.590 --> 19:14.780
<b>I have to... fight that in this situation?</b>

19:14.890 --> 19:15.990
<b>That's not good.</b>

19:24.190 --> 19:26.190
<b>Something at this level...</b>

19:26.190 --> 19:30.360
<b>The old you would've been
able to overcome it easily.</b>

19:30.820 --> 19:32.780
<b>Still, this war...</b>

19:32.780 --> 19:36.260
<b>It really is such a disappointing fight.</b>

19:36.660 --> 19:39.050
<b>I couldn't achieve my original goal,</b>

19:39.050 --> 19:41.510
<b>and I lost soldiers I shouldn't have.</b>

19:41.750 --> 19:45.730
<b>I've received a lot of damage myself, too.</b>

19:45.920 --> 19:46.790
<b>However...</b>

19:48.520 --> 19:51.180
<b>I have gained something
even greater than that.</b>

19:53.760 --> 19:55.800
<b>Had you done what I did</b>

19:56.050 --> 20:01.730
<b>and sacrificed your own soldiers,
I probably would've been the one to die.</b>

20:02.890 --> 20:04.150
<b>Great work.</b>

20:06.310 --> 20:07.110
<b>Yes.</b>

20:07.480 --> 20:08.900
<b>Soon.</b>

20:09.610 --> 20:12.360
<b>Soon, this world will end,</b>

20:12.570 --> 20:14.320
<b>and we will be in a new world!</b>

20:15.870 --> 20:19.160
<b>I won't let you do as you want!</b>

20:31.260 --> 20:33.260
<b>Yes, I know that.</b>

20:33.690 --> 20:36.930
<b>You're placing your hope on someone else.</b>

20:37.300 --> 20:41.020
<b>Someone even the current me fears.</b>

20:41.390 --> 20:45.100
<b>As far as I'm aware,
the strongest one awakened.</b>

20:45.690 --> 20:48.520
<b>However, stopping him is a simple matter.</b>

20:49.750 --> 20:51.360
<b>You don't know that, though.</b>

20:51.500 --> 20:53.380
<b>The unease he has within him,</b>

20:53.570 --> 20:54.950
<b>the sadness...</b>

20:55.400 --> 20:57.370
<b>Humans are weak.</b>

20:57.570 --> 21:02.620
<b>There is no one in this world who
can endure a world full of despair.</b>

21:02.970 --> 21:05.250
<b>Even if it's him.</b>

21:05.920 --> 21:08.770
<b>The moment he has to kill his old comrade,</b>

21:09.090 --> 21:12.300
<b>Helck will surely fall under this power.</b>

21:12.630 --> 21:13.960
<b>Surely.</b>

22:44.970 --> 22:49.970
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:44.970 --> 22:49.970
<b>Chosen Path</b>

22:44.970 --> 22:48.450
<b>Next episde, "Chosen Path".</b>
